  "description": "The ultimate titanium expression of gravel speed.\nEvery line, every weld, every detail is purpose-built to break PRs. Assembled using our Race Super Light (RSL) titanium tube set, the Routt CRD (Complete Race Design) sheds weight without compromise, delivering unmistakable Moots ride quality in its fastest form.\n3D-printed dropouts and brake mounts bring exacting alignment to the rear end. A threaded T47 bottom bracket and UDH compatibility ensure lasting serviceability. Up front, a fully integrated cockpit and refined MOOTS gravel fork keep the profile clean, with no visible cables or hoses. Offering up to 45c tire clearance to handle rocks, grit, and unpredictable terrain.\nThe Routt CRD is precision shaped for riders who demand a more traditional frame geometry that offers speed and durability from the artistry and perfection of titanium.",
